# Keypairs (be careful with sensitive keys!)
# NOTE: id.json and alice.json were previously committed to this repo despite
# this section. id.json's public key matches a hardcoded protocol admin in
# programs/solve/src/auth/admin.rs and programs/token/src/auth/admin.rs, so
# its private key must be treated as fully compromised -- rotate it (new
# keypair, updated ADMINS array, program redeploy) and scrub it from git
# history; removing it from the tree here only stops new clones from getting
# it going forward.
id.json
alice.json
phantom_key.txt
*.keypair.json
auto-vote-keeper.json
vesolve-deploy-buffer.json

